      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, benzos? i thought codeine and hydrocodone were opioids, not benzos. also id rather not deal with the hassle of getting a prescription if i can help it... is there like a strong over the counter thing that works much better than the guaifenesin stuff? im really struggling to sleep cuz of the hacking.",
